A fence a quote's attached block opens ends with its container

````
> :: t
+
: - ``` js
> q
.
<blockquote>
  <dl>
    <dt>t</dt>
    <dd>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <pre><code class="language-js"></code></pre>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </dd>
  </dl>
  <p>q</p>
</blockquote>
````

